{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794250322906,"sessionID":"ses_e3e623d17ffeUdo6wWXu4BtdnB","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01CJ5QxMsnZnPEJdKSsgPmuN","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Development\n\n- Backend smoke tests: `python tests/smoke_test.py` (needs the backend requirements installed).\n- Frontend: `cd frontend && npm run typecheck && npm run build` (Tailwind CSS via `@tailwindcss/vite`).\n- XML checking (`backend/xmlcheck.py`) uses expat; external entities and DTDs are never fetched or resolved.\nEOF\nrm -rf data backend/__pycache__ tests/__pycache__; git status --short","workdir":"/workspace"},"output":" M README.md\n M backend/app.py\n M frontend/index.html\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.tsx\n M frontend/src/main.tsx\n M frontend/vite.config.ts\n?? .gitignore\n?? backend/xmlcheck.py\n?? frontend/src/api.ts\n?? frontend/src/components/\n?? frontend/src/index.css\n?? frontend/tsconfig.json\n?? tests/\n","metadata":{"output":" M README.md\n M backend/app.py\n M frontend/index.html\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.tsx\n M frontend/src/main.tsx\n M frontend/vite.config.ts\n?? .gitignore\n?? backend/xmlcheck.py\n?? frontend/src/api.ts\n?? frontend/src/components/\n?? frontend/src/index.css\n?? frontend/tsconfig.json\n?? tests/\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Development\n\n- Backend smoke tests: `python tests/smoke_test.py` (needs the backend requirements installed).\n- Frontend: `cd frontend && npm run typecheck && npm run build` (Tailwind CSS via `@tailwindcss/vite`).\n- XML checking (`backend/xmlcheck.py`) uses expat; external entities and DTDs are never fetched or resolved.\nEOF\nrm -rf data backend/__pycache__ tests/__pycache__; git status --short","time":{"start":1794250322865,"end":1794250322885}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1a